* `key in d` :: Right. The same lookup.
* `del d[key]` :: Right. Find it, then remove it.
- Finding the smallest key :: A hash map keeps no order, so every key must be checked: O(n).
- Listing all the keys in sorted order :: That needs sorting: O(n log n).
